# Strike Protocol — environment (copy to .env, fill in, DO NOT commit .env).
#
# Discord Activity OAuth token exchange. Required ONLY when running as a Discord
# Activity (embedded in a voice channel). Plain browser play (/, /play) works without
# any of these — the bootstrap is a no-op outside Discord.
#
# These are the SAME NEXA bot application's credentials (the bot and the Activity are
# one Discord app). They mirror central-server's CONNECT_DISCORD_CLIENT_ID / _SECRET.
#   - Get both from the Discord Developer Portal -> NEXA app -> OAuth2.

# PUBLIC — Client ID of the NEXA app. Shipped to the browser (VITE_ prefix). NOT a secret.
# Same value as central-server's CONNECT_DISCORD_CLIENT_ID.
VITE_DISCORD_CLIENT_ID=

# SERVER-ONLY — read by the /api/token route to exchange the OAuth code. The browser
# NEVER sees these. Same values as central-server's CONNECT_DISCORD_CLIENT_ID / _SECRET.
DISCORD_CLIENT_ID=
DISCORD_CLIENT_SECRET=
